menu "App WebRTC Configuration"

    config KVS_MAX_CONCURRENT_STREAMS
        int "Maximum concurrent streams"
        default 2
        range 1 5
        help
            Maximum number of concurrent WebRTC streams. (Tested for MAX 3 with 16 MAX sockets setting)
            Please increase max sockets from 10 to larger number if you wish to use higher simultaneous connections.
            Note that more simultaneous connection means higher memory usage

    config APP_WEBRTC_MAX_EVENT_CALLBACKS
        int "Maximum event callback handlers"
        default 5
        range 1 16
        help
            Maximum number of event callback handlers that can be registered.
            Each handler receives all WebRTC events. Increase if you need more handlers.

    config APP_WEBRTC_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "WebRTC run task stack size (bytes)"
        default 16384
        range 8192 65536
        help
            Stack size for the main WebRTC run task. Use 16384 when using
            esp_websocket_client based signaling. Increase to 32K when using
            libwebsockets based signaling which requires more stack.

endmenu
